  "description": "In a society where only alphas and omegas matter, beta Kim Min-Jun has spent his life being overlooked. Everything changes when elite alpha Bae Yu-Ri, desperate to escape his role, asks Min-Jun to act as his stand-in. What begins as a simple business arrangement slowly turns intoxicating, as Min-Jun discovers how it feels to be the one giving orders and Yu-Ri finds himself responding like the omega he always wished he could be. In a world with such strict social hierarchies, can they resist the pull of a desire that breaks every rule?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
